# Secrets: the OpenAI key and the alert webhook.
.env

# Per-run working artifacts. out/ holds the generated Short and its gate reasoning,
# logs/ the run logs. Both are regenerated every run and neither is a record worth
# keeping in history — state/ is, and IS tracked: it remembers what has already been
# made so the next run does not repeat a topic, which is the job medAI's daily-log did.
out/
logs/

# Footage is large, personal, and in some cases covered by a release that is not
# ours to redistribute. Registered through assets.sh; the registry itself is tracked.
assets/footage/
